"m_completed":true,"m_constraintList":[{"m_locked":false,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-5755343108186137879,"m_classType":"DeviceLockedConstraint","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"a":true,"m_screenOn":true,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-8344597909429500883,"m_classType":"ScreenOnOffConstraint","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"m_inForeground":true,"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-8074492636377202083,"m_classType":"LauncherIsInForegroundConstraint","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false}],"m_description":"🤝 Quickly share your contacts using QR codes.\n\n⚠️ Important: There is no more convenient way at the moment, so go to Action Blocks -\u003e ShakeContactsSettings -\u003e QR Version -\u003e Select the save folder \"/sdcard/MacroDroid/ShakeContacts\"\n\n⭐️ Key features:\n- Launch by shaking the device\n- Works only on the home screen to prevent accidental activation\n- Contact selection menu\n- Share phone number\n- Share WhatsApp\n- Share Telegram\n- Automatically generate and display QR codes\n- QR codes are saved locally for instant access\n- Automatic language detection (multilingual)\n\n⚙️ Macro settings:\n- Run it once and enter your contact information\n- QR codes will be generated automatically\n- Grant storage access if requested\n\n💡 Features:\n- Share contacts in seconds without typing\n- Works with any QR scanner\n- All data is stored locally on your device\n- No Internet connection required after setup","m_descriptionOpen":false,"m_enabled":true,"m_excludeLog":false,"m_headingColor":-11382190,"m_isOrCondition":false,"m_name":"ShakeContacts 🤝","m_triggerList":[{"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-6707843948175058015,"m_classType":"ShakeDeviceTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false},{"disableLogging":false,"m_SIGUID":-6468706019911997946,"m_classType":"EmptyTrigger","m_comment":"","m_constraintList":[],"m_isDisabled":false,"m_isOrCondition":false}]},"macroExportVersion":1}